Recommends: qt6-wayland, tesseract-ocr-osd, tesseract-ocr-fra, ffmpeg, gstreamer1.0-tools, gstreamer1.0-pipewire, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good
Suggests: gnome-session-canberra
Description: document scanning for CZUR Lens USB document cameras
 LensScan drives CZUR Lens document cameras (USB 1e4f:1227 and other UVC
 models) on Linux: live preview, automatic page detection and deskewing,
 curved book flattening, colour modes, batch page tools, export to PDF, TIFF,
 PNG, JPEG and BMP, text recognition (Tesseract) to searchable PDF, Word,
 Excel and text files, and a presentation mode with drawing, video and screen
 recording.
 .
 This is an independent project, not affiliated with CZUR.
